      "en": "David was thirty years old when he began to reign, and he reigned forty years.",
      "ko": "다윗이 삼십세에 위에 나아가서 사십년을 다스렸으되",
      "source_text_hash": "d96822790774f8942728c57cbb5805bd33ef9d9c51007de63c1f53b7db0c5a18",
      "translation_text_hash": "0b1dcde941ab2fca0a65153dd29ac7b2b118945b3d99b0a2b6a3237514d45ce2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "다윗이 삼십세에 위에 나아가서 사십년을 다스렸으되"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0b1dcde941ab2fca0a65153dd29ac7b2b118945b3d99b0a2b6a3237514d45ce2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2SA:5:5",
      "sequence": 8138,
      "chapter_label": "2SA 5",
      "verse_label": "5",
      "locator": {
