      "en": "David lived in the stronghold, and called it David’s city. David built around from Millo and inward.",
      "ko": "다윗이 그 산성에 거하여 다윗성이라 이름하고 밀로에서부터 안으로 성을 둘러 쌓으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "864c06a366f3ba7a6915b92899d166b94c29b55c58e8ca9ab8b651fe511e600c",
      "translation_text_hash": "0e7faf76f2f98e7793e1ab99d75ac2fa03273143833685f2b78c2b7589fe55b6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
