      "en": "David inquired of the LORD, saying, “Shall I go up against the Philistines? Will you deliver them into my hand?” The LORD said to David, “Go up; for I will certainly deliver the Philistines into your hand.”",
      "ko": "다윗이 여호와께 물어 가로되 내가 블레셋 사람에게로 올라가리이까 여호와께서 저희를 내 손에 붙이시겠나이까 여호와께서 다윗에게 말씀하시되 올라가라 내가 단정코 블레셋 사람을 네 손에 붙이리라 하신지라",
      "source_text_hash": "91cd5481dd7e0fb2765c417910f12d00eedbd844934bedb787881e92ef0b98eb",
      "translation_text_hash": "cb858ccf08862d16d0c5ebdb14ce7eb3124aebb9f7f4d4e97e65aab5fc835bf8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
